{
  "_notes": [
    "Three source types feed one dashboard, grouped by 'section'.",
    "ebay_searches: official eBay UK Browse API. type = car | scooter | goods.",
    "  category_ids restrict results to a real eBay category so parts/accessories can't sneak in.",
    "  Clean single-brand scooter categories: Vespa 9936, Lambretta 36094 (these makes only sell scooters).",
    "  Honda 9806 / Yamaha 9809 / BMW 9915 categories also contain big motorbikes, so those searches use",
    "  must_include model names to keep only the scooters.",
    "  Makes with no category (Royal Alloy, Scomadi, Peugeot, Piaggio) use a model-name query + a price floor.",
    "feeds: RSS URLs (CamelCamelCamel price drops, HotUKDeals keyword deals) - paste real URLs over the placeholders.",
    "Facebook / Gumtree / Preloved / Vinted have no API - use their saved-search email alerts into a Gmail 'forecourt' label."
  ],

